flowchart TB
    UI[Role-aware bento interface] --> Middleware[Rate limiter - request ID - security headers]
    Middleware --> Auth[JWT and active account checks]
    Auth --> Access[Role and object ownership authorization]
    Access --> Admin[Accounts and catalogue]
    Access --> OrderService[Order transaction service]
    Access --> Planning[CSV import and forecast service]
    Access --> Analytics[Aggregates and CSV reports]
    Admin --> DB[(PostgreSQL)]
    OrderService --> DB
    Planning --> DB
    Analytics --> DB
    Middleware --> Redis[(Redis counters)]
    Middleware --> Metrics[Prometheus counters and histograms]
